    description: "FOUND 2026-09-24 in WI-mapor's nix A/B (postgrest). A curried application emits one calls edge per application level.\n\n`checkedShellScript { name = ...; } ''...''` parses as apply_expression(apply_expression(checkedShellScript, {...}), ''...''). Pass 2 visits BOTH apply_expression nodes, and each resolves its innermost function to checkedShellScript, so one call site yields 2 identical edges at one line. Present on dev before WI-mapor (13 edges on postgrest, 6 of them in 3 duplicate pairs), and unchanged by it.\n\nASKED: emit the edge from the OUTERMOST apply_expression of a chain only (skip an apply_expression whose parent is an apply_expression with it as the function child). Measure the edge delta on postgrest and loki."  # 2d2e
    fields: {}  # 2d2e
